    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okusaba kwa bahara ba Zerofehaadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo bahara ba Zerofehaadi mutabani wa Hefa, mutabani wa Makiri, mutabani wa Manaase, ayarugire omu kitabu kya Manaase mutabani wa Yosefu bairiire haihi. Ganu nugo mabara ga bahara be: Mahabaha, Noha, Hogura, Mirika na Tiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baayemerra omumaiso ga Musa na Eryeza nyakatagara n'omumaiso g'abeebembezi n'ekitebe kyona, ha mulyango ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu baagamba bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Isiitwe akagwa omwirungu, akaba atali omu hali abo ab'omu kitebe kya Koora abaayekobere kwemera MUKAMA, baitu akaitwa ekibi kye wenka; kandi atasige mwana w'obwojo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isiitwe ogu asemeriire kuhwerekererra kimu mu bantu ab'ekitebe kye habw'okutasiga mwana w'obwojo? Mutuhe obwikaro omu bantu ab'oruganda rwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebigambo byabo, Musa yabihikya hali MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yamugarukamu ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.36.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kubar 36:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bahara ba Zerofehaadi nibagamba ekihikire; obahe ebintu eby'obugwetwa omu bantu ab'oruganda rwa ise bo, nabo obahikyeho obugwetwa bwa ise bo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ogambire Abaisirairi ngu: ‘Kakuba omusaija afa atakazaire mwana w'obwojo, ebintu bye bitwarwege muhara we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kakuba aba atasigire noobwakubaire mwana w'obwisiki, ebintu bye bitwarwege abaanyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi obu araabaga atanyina abaanyina, obu ebintu bye bitwarwege baisento. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ise obu araabaga ataina wanyina, ebintu bye bitwarwege ow'oruganda rwe, ow'ekitabu kye; ogu nuwe agweterwe ebintu bye. Eki kibege kiragiro eki baraahikirizaaga nkooku MUKAMA yaragiire Musa.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.27.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa naakoma Yoswa agaruke omu bigere bye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
